### Third-Party & Open Source APIs Attribution

This project connects to and consumes data from external open-source, open-data, and public APIs:
- **BMKG (Badan Meteorologi, Klimatologi, dan Geofisika)** — Open seismic and disaster data feeds (InaTEWS).
- **USGS (United States Geological Survey)** — Earthquake Hazards Program Real-time GeoJSON feeds (Public Domain).
- **IOC / UNESCO (Intergovernmental Oceanographic Commission)** — Sea Level Station Monitoring Facility (Open Access).
- **MAGMA Indonesia / PVMBG (Pusat Vulkanologi dan Mitigasi Bencana Geologi)** — Volcanic activity reports.
- **Open-Meteo API** — Weather, marine forecast, and atmospheric data (Open Database License / Non-Commercial/Attribution terms).

All external data sources, APIs, trademarks, and logos belong to their respective organizations and creators.

